      "string_value": "Not An Apicbase Alternative: Plan There, Order Aloud"
     },
     {
      "prop_id": "d410be85-5d89-9215-6f62-195b0e3f7c44",
      "type": "string",
      "string_value": "VoiceOrder Solutions lets you say aloud the order you planned in Apicbase, as long as your distributor carries our app. You order from the guide and the prices they keep for your account, and orders you send in the app get a number, a time and a confirmation on your phone."
